==== Network Interfaces ====

^ Interface Name  ^ Description                          ^
| wan             | Interface for WAN Port               |
| lan1            | Interface for LAN 1 Port             |
| lan2            | Interface for LAN 2 Port             |
| lan3            | Interface for LAN 3 Port             |
| lan4            | Interface for LAN 4 Port             |
